WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.183 --> 00:00:01.513
- Good morning Believe Nation!

00:00:01.513 --> 00:00:05.164
Today's message is keep moving forward.

00:00:05.164 --> 00:00:06.674
Over to you, Johnny Depp.

00:00:06.674 --> 00:00:08.983
(rooster crows)

00:00:08.983 --> 00:00:11.529
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:11.529 --> 00:00:14.244
♫ Espresso keep me goin'

00:00:14.244 --> 00:00:18.426
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:18.426 --> 00:00:20.114
- One of the greatest
pieces of advice I've ever

00:00:20.114 --> 00:00:21.867
gotten in my life was from my mom.

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:23.926
When I was a little kid,

00:00:23.926 --> 00:00:26.993
there was a kid who was
bugging me in school.

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:30.077
And she said, "Okay, I'm
going to tell you what to do."

00:00:30.077 --> 00:00:31.993
She said, "The kid's bugging you,

00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:36.160
"he puts his hands on you,
you pick up the nearest rock

00:00:37.274 --> 00:00:38.686
"or whatever you can get your hands on,

00:00:38.686 --> 00:00:39.856
"and you lay him out."

00:00:39.856 --> 00:00:43.382
(audiences laughs)

00:00:43.382 --> 00:00:45.989
- [Audience Member] Yay mom!

00:00:45.989 --> 00:00:46.905
- Then I did.

00:00:46.905 --> 00:00:48.704
(audience laughs loudly)

00:00:48.704 --> 00:00:50.622
And I felt better.

00:00:50.622 --> 00:00:51.860
And it worked.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.419
(audience laughs)

00:00:54.419 --> 00:00:57.836
So for me that was a great lesson because

00:00:59.614 --> 00:01:03.531
someone had invaded my
space, invaded my being.

00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:09.364
And was doing something
against me that I didn't

00:01:09.364 --> 00:01:13.830
want to be done so I took
control of the situation

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:15.330
and I ran with it.

00:01:18.989 --> 00:01:21.322
When years later after being

00:01:23.085 --> 00:01:25.254
turned into a product

00:01:25.254 --> 00:01:27.421
by a very huge corporation

00:01:29.498 --> 00:01:31.673
that had their hands all over me

00:01:31.673 --> 00:01:33.756
and I couldn't escape it.

00:01:37.169 --> 00:01:41.336
I promised myself that I would
continue to move forward, and

00:01:44.263 --> 00:01:47.563
do my best not to compromise
in any way, whatsoever.

00:01:47.563 --> 00:01:51.014
Not allow anyone to put their hands on me

00:01:51.014 --> 00:01:52.492
and affect me in that way.

00:01:52.492 --> 00:01:56.226
So that's the best advise I
think I could give is just

00:01:56.226 --> 00:01:58.829
to keep moving forward and
don't give a (bleep) what

00:01:58.829 --> 00:02:00.895
anybody thinks, just keep moving forward

00:02:00.895 --> 00:02:03.645
and what you have to do, for you.

00:02:04.602 --> 00:02:06.554
- Starting a business is
going to be one of the hardest

00:02:06.554 --> 00:02:08.551
things you ever do in your life.

00:02:08.551 --> 00:02:10.213
You're going to come up
against challenges that you

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:12.287
never thought were possible.

00:02:12.287 --> 00:02:16.097
Hardships that you never
imagined having to endure.

00:02:16.097 --> 00:02:17.881
You have to keep moving forward.

00:02:17.881 --> 00:02:19.572
You're going to have all
kinds of people in your life

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:22.630
tell you all the reasons why
it's not going to work out.

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:24.260
Why you can never do this.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:26.161
And maybe you have that
voice inside your head

00:02:26.161 --> 00:02:29.783
as well saying, "I can't do this."

00:02:29.783 --> 00:02:31.430
You need to keep moving forward.

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:34.803
"But Evan you don't understand,
my situation is different.

00:02:34.803 --> 00:02:37.200
"I didn't grow up with the
family that could help me.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.571
"I didn't grow up with the resources.

00:02:38.571 --> 00:02:40.010
"I didn't have the right education.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.563
"I don't have the right connections.

00:02:41.563 --> 00:02:44.959
"I don't have the financing to
get my dreams into reality."

00:02:44.959 --> 00:02:46.832
You need to keep moving forward.

00:02:46.832 --> 00:02:50.181
There will be times where
you will get hit so hard.

00:02:50.181 --> 00:02:52.824
That you will feel so
terrible about yourself.

00:02:52.824 --> 00:02:55.265
That you will bawl your face off.

00:02:55.265 --> 00:02:57.606
That you will have the
lowest self-confidence ever

00:02:57.606 --> 00:03:01.663
in your life because you're
pouring everything you have

00:03:01.663 --> 00:03:04.729
into this idea and it's not working out

00:03:04.729 --> 00:03:06.741
and you're not getting results.

00:03:06.741 --> 00:03:09.013
You need to keep moving forward.

00:03:09.013 --> 00:03:10.510
There's going to be times
when you look at yourself

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:11.646
in the mirror and you ask,

00:03:11.646 --> 00:03:13.365
why am I doing this?

00:03:13.365 --> 00:03:15.265
Is this worth the sacrifice?

00:03:15.265 --> 00:03:16.830
Is this worth the pain?

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.719
Is this worth the struggle?

00:03:18.719 --> 00:03:20.834
You better have a big dream.

00:03:20.834 --> 00:03:22.679
And you need to keep moving forward.

00:03:22.679 --> 00:03:25.897
Big things aren't created by
people who live their life

00:03:25.897 --> 00:03:28.710
according to other people's expectations.

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:32.269
Big things are not created by
people who stop taking action

00:03:32.269 --> 00:03:33.835
because they're afraid.

00:03:33.835 --> 00:03:35.907
Big things aren't created by people who,

00:03:35.907 --> 00:03:39.549
as soon as they come across
some adversity, they quit.

00:03:39.549 --> 00:03:41.393
You need to keep moving forward.

00:03:41.393 --> 00:03:43.323
Moving forward is hard.

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:44.664
It can suck.

00:03:44.664 --> 00:03:47.042
It can take everything out of you.

00:03:47.042 --> 00:03:49.922
But you owe it to yourself
to make this dream

00:03:49.922 --> 00:03:53.259
that you have in your head come out.

00:03:53.259 --> 00:03:55.731
Keep moving forward.

00:03:55.731 --> 00:03:56.969
So the question of the day today is,

00:03:56.969 --> 00:04:01.304
I'm curious, what are you
doing every single day

00:04:01.304 --> 00:04:03.987
to keep moving forward?

00:04:03.987 --> 00:04:05.202
Leave it in the comments below.

00:04:05.202 --> 00:04:06.700
I'm going to join in the discussion.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.312
I also want to give a quick
shout-out to Anil Grandhi.

00:04:09.312 --> 00:04:11.389
Anil thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:04:11.389 --> 00:04:14.460
Your One Word, it really really
really means a lot to me.

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.052
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:04:16.052 --> 00:04:17.294
I believe in you.

00:04:17.294 --> 00:04:19.467
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself.

00:04:19.467 --> 00:04:22.671
And whatever your one word is, much love,

00:04:22.671 --> 00:04:24.466
and I'll see you again
tomorrow morning for another

00:04:24.466 --> 00:04:26.391
shot of Entspresso.

00:04:26.391 --> 00:04:29.078
♫ I wake up every morning

00:04:29.078 --> 00:04:32.820
♫ Espresso keep me goin'

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.388
- Hey guys to stay on the theme of,

00:04:34.388 --> 00:04:36.651
keep moving forward, I
thought I'd share a few

00:04:36.651 --> 00:04:40.312
extra bonus clips to keep you motivated.

00:04:40.312 --> 00:04:43.419
- Essentially, and I would
say this to anybody, is that

00:04:43.419 --> 00:04:45.502
it's really, it's easy to

00:04:47.698 --> 00:04:51.910
embrace hopelessness when
things seem insurmountable.

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:56.372
And yet, it's actually
just a matter of time

00:04:56.372 --> 00:04:58.088
until all of the elements
come together for

00:04:58.088 --> 00:04:59.424
things to be all right.

00:04:59.424 --> 00:05:01.841
I believe that most difficult

00:05:03.882 --> 00:05:07.333
situations will resolve
themselves if you are persistent

00:05:07.333 --> 00:05:09.236
and if you don't,

00:05:09.236 --> 00:05:11.004
if you don't give up entirely.

00:05:11.004 --> 00:05:12.735
And that's what I never
did, I never gave up.

00:05:12.735 --> 00:05:15.986
- Surely the opening vistas of space

00:05:15.986 --> 00:05:20.153
promise high costs and hardships,
as well as high reward.

00:05:21.651 --> 00:05:25.478
So it is not surprising
that some would have us

00:05:25.478 --> 00:05:28.329
stay where we are a little longer,

00:05:28.329 --> 00:05:29.746
to rest, to wait.

00:05:30.707 --> 00:05:34.842
But this city of Houston,
this state of Texas,

00:05:34.842 --> 00:05:36.620
this country of the United States

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:40.001
was not built by those
who waited and rested

00:05:40.001 --> 00:05:41.317
and wished to look behind them.

00:05:41.317 --> 00:05:45.234
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:55.487
This country was conquered
by those who moved forward

00:05:55.487 --> 00:05:57.126
and so will space.

00:05:57.126 --> 00:06:00.440
- Nothing in life worth having comes free.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:04.057
Nobody's going to give anybody anything.

00:06:04.057 --> 00:06:07.601
Now, you get out of life what
you're willing to put into it.

00:06:07.601 --> 00:06:11.145
Hard work, sacrifice, dedication,

00:06:11.145 --> 00:06:13.978
all of these things breed success.

00:06:14.839 --> 00:06:17.589
Now, I can tell you this because,

00:06:19.231 --> 00:06:23.295
I was once one of the people
who were assumed to be

00:06:23.295 --> 00:06:26.470
less likely to become successful.

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:29.470
I'm from a very modest neighborhood.

00:06:31.519 --> 00:06:34.352
(audience laughs)

00:06:35.531 --> 00:06:37.864
I didn't necessarily grow up

00:06:39.389 --> 00:06:41.139
with a silver spoon in my mouth.

00:06:41.139 --> 00:06:43.343
I didn't have all the
things that I wanted.

00:06:43.343 --> 00:06:46.544
Sometimes not even all
the things that I needed.

00:06:46.544 --> 00:06:49.544
But, it's important for you to know,

00:06:50.435 --> 00:06:53.483
your environment does not define you

00:06:53.483 --> 00:06:55.400
unless you allow it to.

00:06:56.446 --> 00:07:00.074
The position that you're in right now,

00:07:00.074 --> 00:07:02.036
the position you're in right now

00:07:02.036 --> 00:07:04.843
does not dictate your future

00:07:04.843 --> 00:07:06.760
unless you allow it to.

00:07:07.702 --> 00:07:09.906
You can look at your
life as it is right now,

00:07:09.906 --> 00:07:12.147
you can look at it.

00:07:12.147 --> 00:07:12.980
You can say,

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:15.817
"Well, I'm not where I
want to be, this isn't

00:07:15.817 --> 00:07:18.434
"where my life will end."

00:07:18.434 --> 00:07:20.836
You can do one of two things.

00:07:20.836 --> 00:07:23.870
You can use it as an excuse to do nothing,

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:27.617
or you can use it as motivation
to push yourself forward.

00:07:27.617 --> 00:07:29.284
The choice is yours.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:33.508
I need you guys to
understand, and believe,

00:07:33.508 --> 00:07:36.706
that anything in life is possible.

00:07:36.706 --> 00:07:41.008
Whatever it is you want to
do, is absolutely possible.

00:07:41.008 --> 00:07:44.862
I don't care how much trouble
you got into up until now.

00:07:44.862 --> 00:07:47.327
I don't care how many things
you may have done wrong.

00:07:47.327 --> 00:07:51.289
I don't care how much you
may not have in your life

00:07:51.289 --> 00:07:52.426
to help you.

00:07:52.426 --> 00:07:55.759
You can do it if you believe in yourself

00:07:56.655 --> 00:07:58.330
enough to make it happen.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.997
If you put enough...

00:08:01.304 --> 00:08:03.642
If you put enough effort and energy,

00:08:03.642 --> 00:08:06.560
and invest enough in your future,

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:08.888
you can do anything in
this world you want to do.

00:08:08.888 --> 00:08:10.650
Anything's possible.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.825
Don't never let nobody tell you,

00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:14.325
what you can't do.

00:08:15.941 --> 00:08:19.922
I started rapping when
I was nine years old.

00:08:19.922 --> 00:08:21.172
Nine years old.

00:08:22.177 --> 00:08:23.732
And I'm from Atlanta.

00:08:23.732 --> 00:08:26.058
So at the time when I was rapping,

00:08:26.058 --> 00:08:29.731
there wasn't no other rappers in Atlanta.

00:08:29.731 --> 00:08:33.078
And I heard every excuse
why I couldn't be a rapper.

00:08:33.078 --> 00:08:36.887
I heard every excuse why
I couldn't be famous.

00:08:36.887 --> 00:08:38.575
Everything from,

00:08:38.575 --> 00:08:40.610
"You can't rap., you're too skinny."

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:42.769
(audience laughs)

00:08:42.769 --> 00:08:45.703
You know, everything from,

00:08:45.703 --> 00:08:50.611
"Don't nobody from the South
make it big and go platinum."

00:08:50.611 --> 00:08:52.952
I heard all these things,
a whole bunch of excuses,

00:08:52.952 --> 00:08:54.843
a whole bunch of reasons why

00:08:54.843 --> 00:08:58.343
I should not believe that I could make it.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.260
But, my belief,

00:09:03.167 --> 00:09:05.908
my belief overcame that doubt

00:09:05.908 --> 00:09:09.097
because I believed in myself.

00:09:09.097 --> 00:09:10.945
And if I can do it, whatever it is

00:09:10.945 --> 00:09:13.722
that I have done, you can do it better.

00:09:13.722 --> 00:09:14.977
- [Audience Member] Yep.
(students chuckle)

00:09:14.977 --> 00:09:16.060
- All of you.

